  m_text: "THE SECOND WHISPER\n\n\"Walk straight ahead, brave explorer,\n\n    Until
    the next hallway appears.\n\n    Three ancient seals guard the treasure,\n\n   
    And only the wise shall pass.\n\n    First, awaken the Moon of blue,\n\n    Then
    call upon the golden Sun,\n\n    At last, let the purple Star shine.\n\n    Follow
    this order, and the ancient gate shall rise,\n\n    Revealing the artifact hidden
    beyond.\"\n\n\u2014 The Forgotten Guardian\n\nPress E to Close"
