      m_Calls: []
  m_text: "THE WHISPER OF THE LOST\n\n\"Follow the path that lies ahead,\nWhere ancient
    steps rise toward the sky.\n\nAscend where silent shadows sleep,\nThen turn where
    the sun goes to die.\n\nBeyond that doorway, a secret awaits.\"\n\n\u2014 A Forgotten
    Explorer\n\nPress E to Close"
